{"seq": 138, "tick": 17, "wall": "2026-08-21T06:00:35+00:00", "type": "llm_call", "data": {"key": "17:a_wang:act", "tier": "dialogue", "provider": "gemini", "model": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "temperature": null, "usage": {"inp": 4672, "out": 151, "c_write": 0, "c_read": 0}, "output": {"thought": "這小子真的在海堤，鐵雄那脾氣要是真跟阿海槓上，兩個人都得死在潮水裡。得把他拽走，別管那破閘了，命要緊。", "action": {"kind": "move_to", "target_area": "海堤", "target_agent": "", "utterance": "", "object": "", "art": ""}, "plan": "火速趕到海堤，不管用拖的還是用拉的，一定要把阿海弄離那個危險地方，立刻往高地跑。"}, "error": null}}
{"seq": 139, "tick": 17, "wall": "2026-08-21T06:00:35+00:00", "type": "llm_call", "data": {"key": "17:shi_lei:act", "tier": "routine", "provider": "gemini", "model": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "temperature": null, "usage": {"inp": 5169, "out": 221, "c_write": 0, "c_read": 0}, "output": {"thought": "阿德現在總算冷靜了，既然他答應盯著，我就守好工具。在那道白線湧起前，誰催都不動，現在只能等。", "action": {"kind": "interact", "target_area": "", "target_agent": "", "utterance": "", "object": "在海堤盯著外海，觀察海面是否有白線湧起的潮訊", "art": ""}, "plan": "守在海堤，只要一看到外海那道白線，立刻動手焊死水閘。"}, "error": null}}
{"seq": 140, "tick": 17, "wall": "2026-08-21T06:00:35+00:00", "type": "llm_call", "data": {"key": "17:gu_chao:act", "tier": "routine", "provider": "gemini", "model": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "temperature": null, "usage": {"inp": 4729, "out": 223, "c_write": 0, "c_read": 0}, "output": {"thought": "阿旺人都在街上了，沒人再卡在海上。鐵雄這死木頭還在等什麼？這閘現在不焊，等潮水真的灌進來就全完了。", "action": {"kind": "speak", "target_area": "", "target_agent": "張鐵雄", "utterance": "鐵雄！阿旺人在街上了，外海沒船了。別等什麼白線，現在就給我把閘焊死！", "object": "", "art": ""}, "plan": "盯著張鐵雄把閘門焊死，確定防線封好後才算完事。"}, "error": null}}
{"seq": 141, "tick": 17, "wall": "2026-08-21T06:00:36+00:00", "type": "llm_call", "data": {"key": "17:a_qian:act", "tier": "routine", "provider": "gemini", "model": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "temperature": null, "usage": {"inp": 5136, "out": 433, "c_write": 0, "c_read": 0}, "output": {"thought": "阿旺這小子總算上岸了，命保住了就好。先把人拉過來，確認他沒受傷，再看看接下來怎麼辦。", "action": {"kind": "move_to", "target_area": "漁市", "target_agent": "", "utterance": "", "object": "", "art": ""}, "plan": "先到漁市和阿旺會合，確認他平安，再考慮水門的事。"}, "error": null}}
